# Copy to .env (never commit .env), then fill in ONE key. The access layer uses
# whichever is here; with both, LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic or gemini chooses.
# Claude (the model the test set's score was recorded with): a paid key from
# https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Gemini (the course's default): a free key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# LLM_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5          or gemini-3.5-flash-lite
